PASS [laptop] tour step 4 caption - Launch slips: each column is a landing date, each row a metric for a 14-day mission. Landing on the nominal date: Sun up 41%, Earth link 21%, both together 13%, longest darkness 8.3 days. A 2-week slip changes that to Sun up 86%, Earth link 0%, both 0%, longest darkness 2.0 days. The best landing in the next 60 days is +48 days with 24%. Click any square to open that date.
